{"chapter-slug":"rw4-05 K","paragraph":446,"wording":"[Geomancer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"the-geomancer","holder-quote":"The [Mage]. The [Geomancer] watched Mars racing towards him, eyes narrowed. She struck the first line of soldiers with a clash that Trey heard even from a distance. Mars’ shield swung like a mace, edge striking a man’s face and caving it in. Her sword flashed, and two warriors stumbled back, falling. But she didn’t stop.","id":"76a76c27-e2a1-5850-a059-5be553beffed"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw4-05 K","paragraph":453,"wording":"[Geomancer]","event":"named","holder-slug":"the-geomancer","holder-quote":"Flos’ voice was quiet. He was watching Mars as she cut through a group of soldiers trying to protect the [Geomancer]. And he was right.","id":"67505817-67a0-5a58-b069-a2be70a0c5fb"}
